    "job_description": "Role Summary\nWe are looking for a Senior Gen AI Engineer to design and scale production-ready AI systems. You will move beyond simple API prompts to architect custom LLM workflows, fine-tune models, and optimize enterprise-grade RAG pipelines.\n\nKey Responsibilities\nLLM Architecting: Design and deploy advanced RAG systems using vector databases (Pinecone, Weaviate)\nModel Engineering: Fine-tune open-source models (Llama, Mistral) using LoRA/QLoRA and PEFT\nAgentic Workflows: Build autonomous agents using LangChain, LangGraph, or LlamaIndex\nOptimization: Implement quantization and performance tuning to reduce latency/cost\nEvaluation: Build frameworks to mitigate hallucinations and ensure model safety/accuracy.\n\nRequired Skills\n\n\n\nCore: Expert Python, PyTorch/TensorFlow, and Hugging Face\nInfrastructure: Proficiency in AWS Bedrock, Azure AI, or Vertex AI\nData: Expertise in vector embeddings, prompt engineering, and semantic search.",
